    <String Id="SumoCheckPython">Check for recommended Python packages during installation.</String>
    <String Id="SumoInstallDependencies">Install the tool dependencies into the active Python.</String>
    <String Id="SumoInstallLibsumo">Install libsumo for Python into the active Python.</String>
    <String Id="SumoLibsumoRemark">Be aware that the installation of the dependencies (by checking the boxes above) might take some minutes and will add packages to your system python even if you cancel the SUMO installation or uninstall it later. If you want to do it manually call 'pip install libsumo -r %SUMO_HOME%/tools/requirements.txt'.</String>
    <String Id="SumoWingetTip">Tip: Use 'winget install SUMO --scope user' to install for the current user only (no admin rights).</String>
